0.0.7-beta (August 8, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

NEW FUNCTIONALITY

- Add scope calculator for setting scope in 1-fathom increments
  based on physical markings and wire counter measurements.


0.0.6-beta (July 16, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

BUG FIX

- convert_xml_btd fills missing temperature/height to work 
  around automatic zero-filling of NAs by Poseidon.

0.0.5-beta (July 16, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

BUG FIX

- Fix convert_tzdb_gps coordinate conversion handling.


0.0.4-beta (July 10, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

FUNCTIONALITY CHANGE

- convert_xml_btd no longer reads cruise and haul from SCS xml
  files to provide greater flexibility in data handling.


0.0.3-beta (May 20, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

BUG FIX

- Fix time and coordinate handling in convert_tzdb_gps.


0.0.2-alpha (May 19, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

NEW FEATURES

- Port CTD to BTD, XML to BTD, TimeZero to GPS, 
  sunrise/sunset calculator, and haul data catch history
  retrieval survey utility functions from R to Python.


gap-at-sea-toolbox 0.0.1-alpha (May 23, 2023)
----------------------------------------------------------------

Initial commit for a demonstration of a Python-based survey 
utility.
